               <code code="69719-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HEALTH CLAIM SECTION"/>
               <title>RECOMMENDED STORAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at controlled room temperature, 20°-25°C (66°-77°F) [See USP Controlled Room Temperature]. After opening, store away from direct sunlight. Close tightly after each use. REFRIGERATION IS NOT REQUIRED.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>TAMPER EVIDENT: Do not use if printed bottle seal around bottle cap is broken or missing.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250915"/>
            </section>
